{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "clients disappear after I send them the information they asked for? The conversation starts well, the client shows interest, you prepare the options, send the brochure, payment plan, ROI calculations, answer the questions, and then the momentum disappears.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000002"}], "text": "Clients may show interest initially, but often disappear after receiving requested information like brochures and payment plans."}, "title": "Client Disappearance", "topic": "real_estate_deals_dubai"}, "content_hash": "9ec8266772e29443038897050ed06db4bb56b39075d5a86796d6efe9eeec2781", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:knowledge:efa79ea15964732d", "metadata_hash": "5f5da20599068b74e28459192545aa344b6e9be3da698a40c961b2184467eea9", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-07", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "00dbd80c955b2284d8d4e29a5a60a37912cef7691bb6880cc169d160f761585a", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KBY6lwvcm9E", "title": "Client Disappearance", "topic": "real_estate_deals_dubai", "topic_slug": "real_estate_deals_dubai"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000003"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "after eleven years in Dubai real estate, I've noticed something different. In many cases, the mistake happens much earlier. The sales process itself is built on assumptions that", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000003"}], "text": "The mistake in real estate sales often happens early in the process due to incorrect assumptions about the market."}, "title": "Real Estate Sales Process Failure", "topic": "real_estate_deals_dubai"}, "content_hash": "9ec8266772e29443038897050ed06db4bb56b39075d5a86796d6efe9eeec2781", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:knowledge:4219d40be23185d2", "metadata_hash": "5f5da20599068b74e28459192545aa344b6e9be3da698a40c961b2184467eea9", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-07", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "00dbd80c955b2284d8d4e29a5a60a37912cef7691bb6880cc169d160f761585a", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KBY6lwvcm9E", "title": "Real Estate Sales Process Failure", "topic": "real_estate_deals_dubai", "topic_slug": "real_estate_deals_dubai"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000006", "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000007", "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000008"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "almost every owner will happily hang you a pocket listing. But getting a real exclusivity or well-priced unit is close to impossible.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000008"}], "text": "In Dubai, exclusivity in property listings is rare, leading to the same property being listed by multiple agents."}, "title": "Differences in Market Dynamics", "topic": "real_estate_deals_dubai"}, "content_hash": "9ec8266772e29443038897050ed06db4bb56b39075d5a86796d6efe9eeec2781", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:knowledge:8344eb9158fee0af", "metadata_hash": "5f5da20599068b74e28459192545aa344b6e9be3da698a40c961b2184467eea9", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-07", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "00dbd80c955b2284d8d4e29a5a60a37912cef7691bb6880cc169d160f761585a", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KBY6lwvcm9E", "title": "Differences in Market Dynamics", "topic": "real_estate_deals_dubai", "topic_slug": "real_estate_deals_dubai"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000013"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "To close off plan, you need at least two face-to-face conversations with the client. In person or online or the video call doesn't matter.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000013"}], "text": "To close off-plan sales, have at least two face-to-face conversations with the client, offering unique information beyond common brochures."}, "title": "Off-Plan Sales Strategy", "topic": "real_estate_deals_dubai"}, "content_hash": "9ec8266772e29443038897050ed06db4bb56b39075d5a86796d6efe9eeec2781", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:knowledge:6146cd7a8accbe95", "metadata_hash": "5f5da20599068b74e28459192545aa344b6e9be3da698a40c961b2184467eea9", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-07", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "00dbd80c955b2284d8d4e29a5a60a37912cef7691bb6880cc169d160f761585a", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KBY6lwvcm9E", "title": "Off-Plan Sales Strategy", "topic": "real_estate_deals_dubai", "topic_slug": "real_estate_deals_dubai"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000014", "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000015", "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000016", "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000017"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "Would that make sense to book a time together on a Zoom so you can see with your own eyes and understand the process before you make any decisions?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000017"}], "text": "Encourage clients to agree to a meeting."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [{"citations": [{"quote": "you invite them to a Zoom, not through the let's go to the Zoom, through the questions.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000014"}], "text": "Clients must perceive a gap in their own understanding."}], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "the right question creates vacuum in the client's mind.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000014"}], "text": "Identify a gap in the client's knowledge through strategic questions."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "Would that make sense to book a time together on a Zoom so you can see with your own eyes and understand the process before you make any decisions?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000017"}], "text": "Propose a meeting to address these gaps."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "the right question creates vacuum in the client's mind. Suddenly, he realizes that the thing you're asking about is exactly the thing he doesn't know.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000014"}], "text": "Use strategic questioning to create a knowledge gap that encourages clients to schedule meetings."}, "title": "Engaging Clients through Questions", "topic": "real_estate_deals_dubai"}, "content_hash": "9ec8266772e29443038897050ed06db4bb56b39075d5a86796d6efe9eeec2781", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:knowledge:0d9bc014e9ae8209", "metadata_hash": "5f5da20599068b74e28459192545aa344b6e9be3da698a40c961b2184467eea9", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-07", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "00dbd80c955b2284d8d4e29a5a60a37912cef7691bb6880cc169d160f761585a", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KBY6lwvcm9E", "title": "Engaging Clients through Questions", "topic": "real_estate_deals_dubai", "topic_slug": "real_estate_deals_dubai"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000021", "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000022"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Your job isn't just to find the client. It's to keep that balance alive long enough for the deal actually to survive all the way to the transfer.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000022"}], "text": "The secondary market in Dubai is fragile, requiring balance to close a deal."}, "title": "Secondary Market Challenges", "topic": "real_estate_deals_dubai"}, "content_hash": "9ec8266772e29443038897050ed06db4bb56b39075d5a86796d6efe9eeec2781", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:knowledge:80a603f015af0bb9", "metadata_hash": "5f5da20599068b74e28459192545aa344b6e9be3da698a40c961b2184467eea9", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-07", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "00dbd80c955b2284d8d4e29a5a60a37912cef7691bb6880cc169d160f761585a", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KBY6lwvcm9E", "title": "Secondary Market Challenges", "topic": "real_estate_deals_dubai", "topic_slug": "real_estate_deals_dubai"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000002", "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000003", "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000004"], "cue": {"citations": [{"quote": "Why do the clients disappear after I send them the information they asked for?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000002"}], "text": "Agents wonder why clients disappear after receiving information."}, "diagnosis": {"citations": [{"quote": "Most agents assume the problem is somewhere in the closing skills. But...", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000003"}], "text": "The real issue may lie earlier in the sales process rather than closing skills."}, "kind": "reported_exchange", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Why do the clients disappear after I send them the information they asked for?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000002"}], "text": "Real estate agents in Dubai frequently lose clients after sending requested information."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Real Estate Advice Failure", "topic": "real_estate_deals_dubai"}, "content_hash": "9ec8266772e29443038897050ed06db4bb56b39075d5a86796d6efe9eeec2781", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:cases:b53ad7ea3ebdeb6d", "metadata_hash": "5f5da20599068b74e28459192545aa344b6e9be3da698a40c961b2184467eea9", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-07-07", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "00dbd80c955b2284d8d4e29a5a60a37912cef7691bb6880cc169d160f761585a", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KBY6lwvcm9E", "title": "Real Estate Advice Failure", "topic": "real_estate_deals_dubai", "topic_slug": "real_estate_deals_dubai"}
