{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000028"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "send him every week activity reports, viewings, offers, how the interest is moving", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000028"}], "text": "Send weekly activity reports to sellers, including viewings and offers, to be seen as irreplaceable."}, "title": "Seller Agent Strategy", "topic": "seller strategy"}, "content_hash": "9ec8266772e29443038897050ed06db4bb56b39075d5a86796d6efe9eeec2781", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:knowledge:5aaaa8890c942128", "metadata_hash": "5f5da20599068b74e28459192545aa344b6e9be3da698a40c961b2184467eea9", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-07", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "00dbd80c955b2284d8d4e29a5a60a37912cef7691bb6880cc169d160f761585a", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KBY6lwvcm9E", "title": "Seller Agent Strategy", "topic": "seller strategy", "topic_slug": "seller-strategy"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000029"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "you have to understand why this buyer is buying. Why now? Why this area? Why this type of property? And why not to just keep renting?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000029"}], "text": "Understand the buyer's motivation and decision reasons, including reasons for not renting."}, "title": "Understanding Buyer Motivation", "topic": "buyer strategy"}, "content_hash": "9ec8266772e29443038897050ed06db4bb56b39075d5a86796d6efe9eeec2781", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:knowledge:46ae9f53c86dd6c6", "metadata_hash": "5f5da20599068b74e28459192545aa344b6e9be3da698a40c961b2184467eea9", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-07", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "00dbd80c955b2284d8d4e29a5a60a37912cef7691bb6880cc169d160f761585a", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KBY6lwvcm9E", "title": "Understanding Buyer Motivation", "topic": "buyer strategy", "topic_slug": "buyer-strategy"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000030", "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000031", "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000032"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "you need a strong network of sellers agent across different areas. Those who hold real stock, who know you and whom you trust", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000030"}], "text": "Build a strong network of seller agents across different areas for access to real stock and local knowledge."}, "title": "Building a Network", "topic": "networking"}, "content_hash": "9ec8266772e29443038897050ed06db4bb56b39075d5a86796d6efe9eeec2781", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:knowledge:990c3179262df7f5", "metadata_hash": "5f5da20599068b74e28459192545aa344b6e9be3da698a40c961b2184467eea9", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-07", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "00dbd80c955b2284d8d4e29a5a60a37912cef7691bb6880cc169d160f761585a", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KBY6lwvcm9E", "title": "Building a Network", "topic": "networking", "topic_slug": "networking"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000031", "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000032", "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000033"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "No one can be a specialist in every single area of Dubai. And I'm not going to pretend I am Mr. Client.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000031"}, {"quote": "Don't pretend to know every area. Build a network of top agents instead", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:u000033"}], "text": "Do not pretend to know every area; instead, connect with specialists and be honest with clients about your core areas."}, "title": "Specializing and Honesty", "topic": "specialization"}, "content_hash": "9ec8266772e29443038897050ed06db4bb56b39075d5a86796d6efe9eeec2781", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7:knowledge:8f53dd3f11bbf004", "metadata_hash": "5f5da20599068b74e28459192545aa344b6e9be3da698a40c961b2184467eea9", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-07", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "00dbd80c955b2284d8d4e29a5a60a37912cef7691bb6880cc169d160f761585a", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-07-how-to-close-off-plan-secondary-deals-in-dubai-in-2026-kby6l-7b0008a9c7", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KBY6lwvcm9E", "title": "Specializing and Honesty", "topic": "specialization", "topic_slug": "